Modifications
-------------
All sources under vendor/libkeyfinder/src/ are verbatim copies from the
pinned upstream commit, EXCEPT:

  - src/fftadapter.cpp — replaced with a portable, dependency-free radix-2
    FFT implementation. Upstream's version hard-requires the third-party
    FFTW3 library (find_package(FFTW3 REQUIRED)). libkeyfinder is explicitly
    designed to allow an alternate FFT adapter (upstream file comment:
    "Included here to allow substitution of a separate implementation .cpp").
    The public interface in src/fftadapter.h is unchanged, so the rest of the
    library is unaffected.

Nothing vendored requires FFTW3, JSON, or soundtouch; only the minimal set of
sources needed for KeyFinder::KeyFinder::keyOfAudio is included, and unused
source files were omitted from the build (see task-9-report.md).